Package: wtwm
Architecture: any
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}, xkb-data
Recommends: foot, xwayland
Description: classic twm-style Wayland compositor
 wtwm is a small wlroots compositor with classic server-side title bars and a
 compatibility parser for twm configuration files. It installs as a separate
 Wayland login session and is co-installable with X11 twm and other desktops.
